      "kind" : "edit.markdownNote",
      "parameters" : {
        "text" : "# Three-phase sinus\nThree numeric Sinusoid nodes keep fixed amplitudes and phases of 0°, 120°, and 240°. Loop supplies a zero-based call index; Math Expression multiplies it by 12° and feeds the same phase shift to all three curves. Thirty calls produce one full cycle while preserving their 120° separation. Draw Curve layers the red, green, and blue signals over a fixed seeded background. Run to save 30 successive image frames. The 33 ms Loop delay begins after each frame is rendered and saved, so playback speed depends on render time."
